---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Responsible Minerals Initiative (RMI) Audit Support | Eurocert"
  description="Responsible Minerals Initiative (RMI) audits - RMAP smelter and refiner assessments covering tin, tantalum, tungsten and gold sourcing by Eurocert Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/rmi/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367852/eurocert/RMI-a.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="RMI Responsible Minerals Initiative"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Responsible Mineral Sourcing &amp; Supply Chain Due Diligence</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">RMI  -  <span class="text-eurogold-400">Responsible Minerals Initiative</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">A global effort to promote responsible sourcing of minerals and drive transparency and accountability in mineral supply chains</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Initiative Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is <span class="text-euro-600">RMI?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The RMI (Responsible Minerals Initiative) is a multi-stakeholder effort to improve the responsible sourcing of minerals from conflict-affected and high-risk areas. The initiative seeks to address the link between minerals and armed conflict or violence as well as contribute to peace and security.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The RMI was launched in 2009 by the Responsible Business Alliance (formerly the Conflict-Free Sourcing Initiative) with support from U.S. State Department&#x27;s Bureau of Democracy, Human Rights, and Labor. The initiative is now managed by an independent secretariat based in Washington, D.C.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">RMI members include companies across the mineral value chain, NGOs, government entities, and other thought leaders committed to improving responsible mineral sourcing practices throughout global supply chains. Members represent a broad range of industries including electronics, jewelry, and steel manufacturing among others.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-tools text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Tools &amp; Resources</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Working together, RMI members have developed tools and resources to support responsible mineral sourcing including a Framework for Responsible Mineral Supply Chains that provides guidance on due diligence practices. It includes an online self-assessment tool for companies to measure their progress on implementing best practices, country profiles with information on risk factors related to specific regions, and case studies highlighting lessons learned from real-world experiences.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784010570/rmi_poe2a3.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="RMI Responsible Minerals Initiative"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Goals of RMI</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The goals of the Responsible Minerals Initiative (RMI) are to promote responsible sourcing of minerals from conflict-affected and high-risk areas, and to build capacity within the mineral supply chain to support responsible practices.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The initiative also aims to engage with key stakeholders, including governments, industry, civil society organizations, and communities affected by mining activities.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-link text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">How RMI Helps</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">RMI works with companies to help them better understand and manage their risks in the minerals sector. It provides tools and resources to help them make informed decisions about sourcing minerals.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">RMI&#x27;s efforts help ensure that minerals are sourced responsibly, from conflict-free areas and in a way that supports local communities. RMI&#x27;s ultimate goal is to contribute to a more responsible minerals trade that supports peace and prosperity for all involved.</p></div></div><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-8 p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-users text-white text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Who are the Members of RMI?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The RMI is an industry-wide effort to ensure that minerals used in products are sourced responsibly from regions of conflict and high risk. Members of RMI include companies throughout the mineral supply chain, including miners, smelters, refiners, manufacturers, and retailers. RMI also works with civil society organizations and governments to promote responsible sourcing practices and develop policies that support them.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784010715/rm_odyaqt.png" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" alt="RMI Responsible Minerals Initiative"/></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Membership Value</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of Being an <span class="text-euro-600">RMI Member</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">RMI is a not-for-profit initiative that brings companies together to drive responsible minerals sourcing throughout their supply chains. By working with RMI, companies can demonstrate their commitment to responsible sourcing and help to build a more sustainable minerals sector.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">RMAP Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Responsible Minerals Assurance Process (RMAP) provides an independent third-party verification of responsible mineral sourcing practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-book-open text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Resource Library</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">A comprehensive online library of resources on responsible minerals sourcing to support your compliance journey.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training Programs</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Training and capacity building programs on responsible minerals sourcing for your teams and supply chain partners.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Stakeholder Engagement</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Engagement with key stakeholders in the minerals sector, including governments, NGOs, and industry associations.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">RMI <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-mountain text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">RMI Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive audits and assessments against responsible sourcing standards for smelters, refiners, and supply chain participants.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Responsible Sourcing Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verify that minerals are sourced from conflict-free and responsible suppliers across your entire value chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-search text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Due Diligence</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Implement robust due diligence across your mineral supply chain in line with OECD guidance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Conflict-Free Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demonstrate commitment to conflict-free mineral sourcing with recognized certification.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-industry text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">RMAP Smelter/Refiner Audits</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Support for Responsible Minerals Assurance Process audits at smelter and refiner level.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Dodd-Frank Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meet U.S. Dodd-Frank Act Section 1502 requirements for conflict minerals reporting.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">EU Conflict Minerals Regulation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comply with EU regulations on responsible mineral sourcing from conflict-affected areas.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Stakeholder Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Provide transparent, credible reporting to stakeholders on your mineral sourcing practices.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose <span class="text-eurogold-400">Eurocert?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in responsible mineral sourcing, conflict-affected supply chains and RMI-aligned assurance.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Meaningful Contribution</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">The RMI has provided companies with necessary guidelines and frameworks to ensure that their supply chains are free from conflict minerals and are fully compliant with global standards.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">By investing in suppliers who have adopted the RMI protocol, businesses around the world will be able to make a meaningful contribution towards improving human rights globally.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span>  -  a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-